  "body": "<p>This Pull Request updates dependency <a href=\"https://github.com/sintaxi/surge\">surge</a> from <code>v0.18.0</code> to <code>v0.19.0</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"commits\">Commits</h3>\n<p><details><br />\n<summary>sintaxi/surge</summary></p>\n<h4 id=\"0190\">0.19.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sintaxi/surge/commit/0d7e643c48cbe450831ee6dba7e9441ba7361f5e\"><code>0d7e643</code></a> adds underscore randomizer</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sintaxi/surge/commit/fe2062c89abbcba09861e2160b6034a273de55da\"><code>fe2062c</code></a> default to https for publishing endpoint</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sintaxi/surge/commit/37807d20fbdecdea8ed934f407c70921956f78b7\"><code>37807d2</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;197 from andyj/patch-1</li>\n</ul>\n<p></details></p>\n<hr />\n<p>This PR has been generated by <a href=\"https://renovateapp.com\">Renovate Bot</a>.</p>",
